Para. 3quater — Inserted by Annex No 2 of the FA of 24. March 2006, in force since 1 April 2007 (AS 2007 921; BBl 2003 7951).
Para. 3quinquies — Inserted in accordance with Annex No 2 of the FA of 24 March 2006, in force since 1 April 2007 (AS 2007 921; BBl 2003 7951).
Para. 4 — Amended by Annex I No II 35 of the Data Protection Act of 25 Sept. 2020, in force since 1 Sept. 2023 (AS 2022 491; BBl 2017 6941).
Para. 5 — SR 235.1
Para. 5 — Second sentence amended by Annex I No II 35 of the Data Protection Act of 25 Sept. 2020, in force since 1 Sept. 2023 (AS 2022 491; BBl 2017 6941).
